<table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" class="bordercolor">
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=640" title="View the profile of articstorm">articstorm</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 4<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=640"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:cseverance@wadsnet.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=850.msg8224#msg8224"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=850.msg8224#msg8224">Conviction...no loyalty to their guildees</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> June 04, 2004, 12:55:06 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							OK here is the long story I have been a member only a couple weeks,but was an app for my due time.I attend over 80% of the raids and do whatever is asked of me.So tonight was are first time raid and i was given my group of 18 and we were all set to go ( keep in mind i am top 3 shammies in aa&#039;s in guild and number 2 wasn&#039;t there).Then Disso desides to pull me and replace me with an ex-foresaken member(lol) not because he is better but because he has been to time(keep in mind conviction never been to time before tonight).So I get pissed and argue to no avail so I just disband guild...screw them this dude has been to all of 3 raids but since he been to time he ousts someone...lol that is bullshit.Also I was up til 7am helping them beat Ikkinz 2 and 3 so they could go to Ikkinz raid and showed for all 3 Ikkinz raids(where was the other ex foresaken shammy...who knows not at the raids..lol).Ok maybe I am whining but i told mmy friends in the guild no worries...just forget about it we can still grind.So we go to do an LDON tonight and they tell me to get in Vent(talk channel) and after 30m minutes they are told by the officers to boot me out or they will be in trouble..OH Boy go Conviction and all your petty shit... BTW i have 336 aa so I have done some work on my toon.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: June 04, 2004, 12:58:35 pm by articstorm</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
