								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							And sometimes... just SOMETIMES... people take a game far more serious than they should at the expense of a good person. And sometimes winning at this game is more important than building confidence and winning the hearts and minds of good people in your guild. But who cares right, the better toon is far superior to the better person anyday right?<br /><br />Getting caught up in the rush, the loot, the bragging rights over this game. <br /><br />D-R-A-M-A.
