	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg8246"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=317" title="View the profile of Vanden RN">Vanden RN</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 197<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I'm a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=317"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=850.msg8246#msg8246"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=850.msg8246#msg8246">Re: Conviction...no loyalty to their guildees</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #7 on:</b> June 04, 2004, 02:23:27 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							/begin  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/drama.gif" alt="Drama!" border="0" /><br /><br />Each guild runs itself different so take this with a grain of salt...<br />If they&#039;re the same class and have the right aa&#039;s and right gear, I&#039;d say the member should be given priority over a non-member unless you&#039;ve been trying repeatedly to defeat something without success.  Granted, I don&#039;t think I know any of the people involved here and only know what&#039;s on this thread.<br /><br />Sure ex-forsaken persons have been there, but so also have the 300 people who leak strats and stuff on all the boards and in /tell.  The member is the one who sticks it through to get the guild where you are, so you&#039;re going to cast him aside in order to plug in a fast-forward person who has yet to become a solid member?  It&#039;s not like you needed to have someone sit out because there&#039;s another class that&#039;s needed more.  Strats are everywhere.<br /><br />Yeah it was foolish for him to just disband like that right away, but you gotta admit it&#039;s probably somewhat demoralizing to more than just Articstorm to see people blocked from their first Time event because a non-member is trusted more.<br /><br />So you gain a smoother transition on your first Time attempt, at the expense of a feeling of unfairness and disagreement within the guild.  Maybe they will balance out.<br /><br />/end  <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/drama.gif" alt="Drama!" border="0" />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: June 04, 2004, 02:25:09 pm by Vanden RN</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg8247"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
