								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=850.msg8253#msg8253">Re: Conviction...no loyalty to their guildees</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #14 on:</b> June 04, 2004, 03:50:28 pm &#187;</span></td>
